120
00:04:19,494 --> 00:04:19,994
Ah...

121
00:04:20,414 --> 00:04:21,164
Is she sick?

122
00:04:21,164 --> 00:04:24,794
It's not that bad.

123
00:04:24,794 --> 00:04:27,134
It's probably just the summer heat.

124
00:04:27,134 --> 00:04:28,384
But...

125
00:04:28,384 --> 00:04:29,214
Yes.

126
00:04:29,214 --> 00:04:32,724
Ever since we had that tug-of-war contest on our grounds, she started feeling strange.

127
00:04:32,724 --> 00:04:34,134
Tug-of-war?

128
00:04:34,134 --> 00:04:37,264
Isn't that what they used to do instead of a battle?

129
00:04:37,264 --> 00:04:38,224
But why?

130
00:04:38,224 --> 00:04:40,774
Hmm... I'm not sure, myself.

131
00:04:41,644 --> 00:04:45,644
